+### task create
+
+Create a task from a natural-language outcome and explain its execution route.
+
+Infers conservative structured intent, stores an explainable automatic route, and stops at the semantic planning boundary.
+
+Usage:
+
+```text
+agentplane task create <outcome> [options]
